ening it up to  academics and they're gonna say hey  academics if you want our data we'll  give it to you and we'll even  financially support you which is  complicated and then they'll be able to  study how much false news there is on  the platform and how it spreads okay  your Facebook has a line they you know  we want to get rid of a hundred percent  of it we have an obligation to it right  now we really don't know we don't know  if there's more or less than there was  last year giving academics access will  certainly help on that Thank You Nick  Thompson thanks a lot thank you tomorrow  we'll continue this conversation because  Facebook's vice president of global  marketing solutions that's carolyn  Everson will be here in studio 57  tomorrow
 

